      "writtenOn": "2025-12-03T19:29:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: +1 WRT calling this CL a revert. It\u0027s a fix forward.\n\nAFAIK, this is probably a beneficial change for at least TCPMv2 ec-legacy boards. It was originally developed for dedede. If we needed to change this value for other TCPMv2 boards, I\u0027d expect that to be in the form of per-board tweaks based on compliance results, not a global revert back to the original minimum value.\n\nI\u0027m not sure about TCPMv1 boards. Besides Servo, I wouldn\u0027t really expect to cherry pick USB tweaks for TCPMv1 boards.",
      "parentUuid": "8d9c5de6_20f20d02",
      "revId": "0b069dde6a5e1e6b34aebb030183531d12393b16",
